  <entity00149655:ExplanationOfPfGuaranteeMaturityDateOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_entity00149655_ContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesRealEstatePfOfContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesRealEstatePfComprehensiveSummaryTableTableOfMember_dart_CategoriesOfBusinessAxis_dart_MaintenanceBusinessMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_OriginalPFMember" xml:lang="ko">복수의 PF 보증이 존재하는 경우, 가장 늦은 만기를 기재하였습니다.</entity00149655:ExplanationOfPfGuaranteeMaturityDateOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems>
  <entity00149655:ExplanationOfPfGuaranteeMaturityDateOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_entity00149655_ContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesRealEstatePfOfContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesRealEstatePfComprehensiveSummaryTableTableOfMember_dart_CategoriesOfBusinessAxis_dart_MaintenanceBusinessMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_OriginalPFMember" xml:lang="ko">복수의 PF 보증이 존재하는 경우, 가장 늦은 만기를 기재하였습니다.</entity00149655:ExplanationOfPfGuaranteeMaturityDateOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems>
  <entity00149655:ExplanationOfPfGuaranteeMaturityDateOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2025dHY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_entity00149655_ContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesRealEstatePfOfContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesRealEstatePfComprehensiveSummaryTableTableOfMember_dart_CategoriesOfBusinessAxis_dart_MaintenanceBusinessMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_OriginalPFMember" xml:lang="ko">복수의 PF 보증이 존재하는 경우, 가장 늦은 만기를 기재하였습니다.</entity00149655:ExplanationOfPfGuaranteeMaturityDateOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems>
  <entity00149655:ExplanationOfRedevelopmentAndReconstructionAssociationsBusinessExpenseLoanAgreement2OfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfContingentLiabilitiesAxis_entity00149655_ContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesRealEstatePfOfContingentLiabilityForGuaranteesMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesRealEstatePfComprehensiveSummaryTableTableOfMember_dart_CategoriesOfBusinessAxis_dart_MaintenanceBusinessMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_dart_OriginalPFMember_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_entity00149655_BusanOfGeographicalAreasMemberOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 재개발 및 재건축 조합의 사업경비 지출을 위해 대여금 약정을 체결하고 있습니다. 연결회사는 이러한 약정에 따른 조합사업경비 대여 시 일부를 금융기관 대출을 주선하여 간접조달하고 있으며, 조합이 수령한 주택금융에 대해 관련 금융기관과의 업무협약에 따라 보증금액(위 표 '보증한도' 참조)을 한도(조합대출 잔액 위 표 '대출잔액' 참조)로 연대보증 및 연대상환 책임을 부담하고 있습니다. 한편, 연결회사는 수령한 주택금융중 미집행잔액을 선수금으로 계상하고 있습니다.</entity00149655:ExplanationOfRedevelopmentAndReconstructionAssociationsBusinessExpenseLoanAgreement2OfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePfGuaranteeLineItemsOfDisclosureOfContingentLiabilitiesForGuaranteesRealEstatePFGuaranteeTableOfItems>
